://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Font_TeamMeat_l.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060746\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"96\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Meatball.png\" data-image-key=\"Meatball.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/0d/Meatball.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821165316\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">15</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>290.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Womb\" title=\"Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Stage_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073122\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utero\" title=\"Utero\"><img alt=\"Stage Utero icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Utero icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Utero_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3d/Stage_Utero_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073102\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Meatballs</b> are grotesque enemies found only in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chapter 4\">Chapter 4</a>. They slowly slide around the room aimlessly. If Isaac is in sight, they will stop to spew a fountain of short-range blood shots in all directions or spit a line of damaging <a href=\"/wiki/Creep#Red_Creep\" title=\"Creep\">Red Creep</a> towards Isaac. Upon death, they spawn a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Host\" title=\"Host\"><img alt=\"Host\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Host.png\" data-image-key=\"Host.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f1/Host.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821091757\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Host\" title=\"Host\">Host</a>, which can be faintly seen partially sticking out of the Meatball on one side.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Meatball_Unused.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825003733\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Unused pre-release sprite for the Meatball found among the Room Editor files.\"><img alt=\"Unused pre-release sprite for the Meatball found among the Room Editor files.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"105\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Meatball Unused.png\" data-image-key=\"Meatball_Unused.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Meatball_Unused.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825003733\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Cut_Content#Cut_Afterbirth_.E2.80.A0_Content\" title=\"Cut Content\">Unused</a> pre-release sprite for the Meatball found among the Room Editor files. </div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Meatballs are one of five enemies (four without Repentance, three without Afterbirth+) in the game that uses <a href=\"/wiki/Creep\" title=\"Creep\">Creep</a> as projectiles, the others are &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fatty#Conjoined_Fatty\" title=\"Fatty\"><img alt=\"Conjoined Fatty\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Conjoined Fatty.png\" data-image-key=\"Conjoined_Fatty.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a2/Conjoined_Fatty.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20230106170402\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fatty#Conjoined_Fatty\" title=\"Fatty\">Conjoined Fatty</a>, <span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fatty#Bloaty\" title=\"Fatty\"><img alt=\"Bloaty\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Bloaty.png\" data-image-key=\"Bloaty.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/0c/Bloaty.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/18?cb=20210824112131\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fatty#Bloaty\" title=\"Fatty\">Bloaty</a>, &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ultra_Pride\" title=\"Ultra Pride\"><img alt=\"Ultra Pride\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Ultra Pride.png\" data-image-key=\"Ultra_Pride.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/5d/Ultra_Pride.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825032721\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ultra_Pride\" title=\"Ultra Pride\">Ultra Pride</a> and <span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220204205709\" /></span></span> &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wall_Creep#The_Thing\" title=\"Wall Creep\"><img alt=\"The Thing\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"The Thing.png\" data-image-key=\"The_Thing.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a9/The_Thing.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20211111111629\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wall_Creep#The_Thing\" title=\"Wall Creep\">The Thing</a>.</li>\n<li>Meatballs are one of two only enemies from the Afterbirth expansion that are entirely new enemies and not new variants of already existing enemies. The other is the &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corn_Mine\" title=\"Corn Mine\"><img alt=\"Corn Mine\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Corn Mine.png\" data-image-key=\"Corn_Mine.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ed/Corn_Mine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210824085436\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Corn_Mine\" title=\"Corn Mine\">Corn Mine</a>. The &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dukie\" title=\"Dukie\"><img alt=\"Dukie\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dukie.png\" data-image-key=\"Dukie.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/99/Dukie.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20211111110640\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dukie\" title=\"Dukie\">Dukie</a> is an exception as it's technically a smaller version of &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Duke_of_Flies\" title=\"The Duke of Flies\"><img alt=\"Boss The Duke of Flies ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss The Duke of Flies ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_The_Duke_of_Flies_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/c2/Boss_The_Duke_of_Flies_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821130551\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Duke_of_Flies\" title=\"The Duke of Flies\">The Duke of Flies</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220204205709\" /></span></span>  Meatballs now make sounds when they attack.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220204205709\" /></span></span>  Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Booster_Packs#Booster_Pack_#5\" title=\"Booster Packs\">Booster Pack #5</a>, Meatballs had a chance to spawn <span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src